  triage:resolutionNotes "Update 2026-08-15 by quality-mgr, AN15FUZZV2-QA1FIX1-VERIFY: arch-ctm's fix at integrate/phase-an @ 565620a32e6aeb3480f7de4da0b26fb8ac1d1769 independently verified via ruthless-boundary-qa. scripts/fuzz/render_report.py no longer contains normalize_worker(), _default_input(), or _default_finding() -- full grep across the tree confirms zero remaining references (dead code and its stale 'AI.48 bounded {worker}campaign' provenance label fully removed, not just commented out). normalize_campaign() confirmed as the sole live path, delegating exclusively to run_fuzz.validate_report() and projecting through _v2_worker_for_panel(). No behavior change to the live report path. Closing." ;
